{"meta":{"id":"basic-types","category":"it/syntax/javascript/types","title":"기본 타입 · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"원시 타입 7가지 + object, let / const, 값에 타입이 있는 동적 타입","tags":["javascript","f-types"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">기본 타입 · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 원시 타입 7가지 + object, let / const, 값에 타입이 있는 동적 타입</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 (typeof 결과)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">타입</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">예시</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>string</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&quot;hello&quot;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>number</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>10, 3.14, NaN</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">정수 · 실수 구분 없음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>bigint</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>100n</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">큰 정수</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>boolean</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>true, false</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">참 / 거짓</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 정의되지 않음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 없음 (typeof null === &quot;object&quot; — 오래된 버그)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>symbol</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Symbol(&quot;id&quot;)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">고유한 식별자</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>object</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>{}, [], function</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">원시 타입이 아닌 모든 값</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">변수 선언</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let count = 0;        // 재할당 가능\r\nconst name = &quot;kim&quot;;   // 재할당 불가\r\nvar old = 1;          // 함수 스코프 (사용 지양)\r\n\r\ncount = &quot;text&quot;;       // 타입이 없으므로 다른 타입도 대입됨 (TypeScript 에서는 오류)\r\nconsole.log(typeof count); // &quot;string&quot;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">변수에는 타입이 없고 <strong>값</strong>에 타입이 있다. 타입은 실행 시점에 정해진다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">TypeScript 와 비교</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">TS 의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>any</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>unknown</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>void</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>never</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>type</code> 은 JS 에 없음 — 타입 검사 전용</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">TS 타입 표기는 컴파일 후 지워져 이 JS 코드가 된다</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/types/basic-types","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/javascript/types"}],"hasImage":false}